# hw3/data/ holds each student's REAL class05 pilot CSV — real data from a
# real classmate. This repo stays private, but your work may end up in a
# public copy you publish after the semester (see the course website's
# Resources page), and anything committed here can end up in that later
# copy unless it's kept out of git entirely.
# HW3's autograder doesn't need this file committed either — it supplies its
# own synthetic stand-in during the automated check on GitHub (see
# hw3/check_hw3.R) — so there's no reason
# for the real file to ever be pushed.
#
# Note: the repo-root data/ folder is NOT covered here. That folder holds
# the final project's simulated data (HW7), which is meant to be committed
# (and is fine in any public copy) — it is never real participant data. The one real
# risk there (class12's debugging-only pilot CSV) is handled by instruction,
# not a file pattern, since it's the same folder legitimate simulated data
# lives in; your instructor will cover this in Class 12.
hw3/data/*.csv

# Instructor-only reference material — lives on the instructor's machine,
# never ships in the repo students copy.
INSTRUCTOR_SETUP.md

# The optional December extra-credit exercise is distributed into student
# repos later in the semester rather than shipping in the template — its
# materials pair with assignments that haven't been handed out yet.
extra_credit/

# Python bytecode cache (created by any local run of the .py checks/scaffolds)
__pycache__/
